# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for the AI Marketing Engine (Community) open-source release
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# === Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit) =================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
*.credentials
secrets.*
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# === Runtime home / application state ======================================
# data/ is a live runtime home directory: databases, sessions, memories,
# logs, caches, auth locks, and a synced copy of the agent. It is machine
# state + personal data, not source. Do NOT publish it.
/data/

# === Generated artifacts ===================================================
# The knowledge index is rebuilt by the admin server at boot and after every
# change (and by `npm run build:index`). Tracking it would mean a diff on every
# boot from the build timestamp and post-clone file mtimes. It is derived data —
# regenerate it, don't version it.
/knowledge/INDEX.md

# === Node / JS =============================================================
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/

# === Python (from vendored tooling) =======================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.direnv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# === Databases & local stores =============================================
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.lock

# === Logs & temp ===========================================================
*.log
logs/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.cache

# === OS / editor cruft =====================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# === Build output ==========================================================
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
